        "definition": "Assigns a ranking to each row based on a specified ordering.<br>The function ranks values within a result set according to a given column, such as price or quantity.<br>Rows with the same value receive the same rank, and the next rank is skipped.<br>This is useful for finding relative positions such as the most expensive or cheapest products.",
